Subject: [PATCH] [M159] [HistoryClusters] Fix UAF in OnUkmNavigationComplete

Original change's description:
> [HistoryClusters] Fix UAF in OnUkmNavigationComplete
>
> Return early from HistoryClustersTabHelper::OnUkmNavigationComplete()
> when the navigation has no incomplete visit context annotations.
> Otherwise, set expect_ukm_page_end_signals = true and scope the
> reference before calling RecordPageEndMetricsIfNeeded(), then re-check
> HasIncompleteVisitContextAnnotations() before copying annotations and
> completing the visit.
>
> Previously, if expect_ukm_page_end_signals was false and history_rows
> was true, RecordPageEndMetricsIfNeeded() would complete and erase the
> IncompleteVisitContextAnnotations entry, leaving the local reference in
> OnUkmNavigationComplete() dangling and causing a use-after-free.
>
